<title>POLAND: Boryszew Q3 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Boryszew Q3 net rises to PLN 2.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boryszew SA results for thethird qurter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				5.85   vs    4.20</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  5.12   vs    4.00</p>
<p>    net					2.88   vs    2.82</p>
